     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi D-RUG-ers...<div><br></div><div>It&#39;s time to vote on when folks might prefer to hold our weekly meetups. These time are based on when we can reserve the DSI space. <i><b>Please submit your vote by Sunday 9/10</b></i>.</div><div><br></div><div><b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/forms/BAePxzJXYJZVKFIl1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://goo.gl/forms/BAePxzJXYJZVKFIl1&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466747589000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Faww1FhMSBYfEf8V0jFzi\">https://goo.gl/forms/BAePxzJXYJZVKFIl1</a></b><br></div><div><br></div><div>In addition, if you have thoughts on talks/workshops you&#39;d like to see, please add them! It&#39;s great to have a few talks/workshops throughout the quarter, and I&#39;m trying to coordinate with the <a href=\"http://dsi.ucdavis.edu/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://dsi.ucdavis.edu/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466747589000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2BCNco6Kif2cb2dD9WULrW\">DSI</a> a bit as well to maximize some of the options.</div><div><br></div><div>If you are interested, the DSI will be holding their &quot;Un-Seminars&quot; on Tuesdays from 12-1, they are a fun relaxed atmosphere to present some troubling problem, cool finding, or just learn about what other cool stuff folks are working on. If you get a chance, definitely swing by.</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks,</div><div><br></div><div>Adios,</div><div>Ryan<br clear=\"all\"><div><br></div><div>*your D-RUG coordinator and champion of coffee</div>-- <br><div class=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br><span style=\"line-height:19px\"><font face=\"times new roman, serif\"><i><b><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;float:none;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);display:inline\"><span> </span></span><br style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\"></b></i></font></span><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\"><font size=\"1\"><i>&quot;When we try to pick out anything by itself, we find it hitched to everything else in the universe.&quot;<b><br>John Muir (My First Summer in the Sierra, 1911)</b></i></font></div><span style=\"line-height:19px\"><font face=\"times new roman, serif\"><i><b>-----------------------------------------------------</b></i></font></span></div><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;line-height:19px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font face=\"times new roman, serif\"><div>Ryan Peek</div><div>PhD Candidate, Graduate Group in Ecology<br></div><div dir=\"ltr\">C